TrackMe 1.8.0

• Pause or finish your ride straight from the notification — no need to unlock and open the app.

• Messages are part of the app now. Confirmations and errors no longer float over it as system popups.

• Settings rebuilt: grouped rows, consistent spacing, and the whole row toggles rather than just the switch.

• Warning text is readable again after failing the accessibility contrast minimum.

Tracking, group rides, sync and export are unchanged.
